OL,3,GNEWSANew all-terrain police vehicle to
OL,4,Apatrol beaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FSussex Police is deploying a new
OL,7,Fall-terrain vehicle (ATV) on Brighton's
OL,8,Fbeaches to support its seafront
OL,9,Fpatrols.
OL,11,FThe ATV will primarily be out at night
OL,12,Fand during the early hours in order to
OL,13,F"keep the public safe, deter crime and
OL,14,Fprovide a highly visible police
OL,15,Fpresence", the force said.
OL,17,FThe specialist vehicle will patrol the
OL,18,Fshingle and has with blue lights, a
OL,19,Fpowerful spotlight and high-powered LED
OL,20,Flighting.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
