OL,3,GNEWSANew all-terrain police vehicle to
OL,4,Apatrol beaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FCh Insp Dan Hiles described its aim as
OL,7,F"making it clear to anyone looking to
OL,8,Fcause harm that they have nowhere to
OL,9,Fhide".
